name csassignments
category Package
revision 63992
shortdesc A wrapper for article with macros and customizations for computer science assignments
longdesc This class wraps the default article and extends it for a
longdesc homogeneous look of hand-in assignments at university (RWTH
longdesc Aachen University, Computer Science Department), specifically
longdesc in the field of computer science, but easily extensible to
longdesc other fields. It provides macros for structuring exercises,
longdesc aggregating points, and displaying a grading table, as well as
longdesc several macros for easier math mode usage.
